# The Black Gate with cheats on: the debug menu's teleport to NPC 110 (Garok, in Dungeon
# Despise), walks in the dark cave, and combat mode on near its monsters.
# Start: the save bg-newgame.scr ends with. Arguments: --program u7 p ABCD<0xFF>
#@start bg-start
#@args --program u7 p ABCD\0377
